These are the moments that make childhood so special — just you and Dad, being the best buddies and creating memories that will last forever. 🥰✨', '2026-03-31', '', 'toddler', 'https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/cover.webp', '["https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-0.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-1.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-2.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-3.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-4.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-5.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-6.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-7.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-8.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-9.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/fun-with-dad-never-ends/gallery/da7b0566-c590-4a03-bd14-8aacb93f953d-10.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshai