Always camera-ready, always giving the perfect pose, and somehow making every click feel like a picture worth keeping forever.

Whether it’s a curious little look, a serious expression, a playful pose, or that adorable innocent stare — you never fail to steal the show. 🥰

Every pose becomes a memory, every click becomes a treasure.
Our little Master Azain, born to be in front of the camera! 👑📸', '2025-08-07', '', 'infant', 'https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/cover.webp', '["https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-0.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-1.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-2.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-3.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-4.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-5.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-6.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-7.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-8.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-9.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-10.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-11.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/photogenic/gallery/d3f1f7cb-a52f-42f1-b284-0b14ce1790cf-12.we