Five months ago, you came into our world and made everything a little brighter, a little happier, and infinitely more beautiful. Now, at five months, you are discovering your tiny hands, your favorite toys, new sounds, endless smiles, and the joy of exploring everything around you.

From your bottles and little medicines to your rattles, colorful toys, and those precious everyday moments, every little thing has become part of your growing story. You are learning, laughing, babbling, and showing us a brand-new version of yourself every single day.

Five months of you. Five months of love. Five months of memories we never want to forget. ✨💙', '2025-02-14', '', 'infant', 'https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/cover.webp', '["https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-0.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-1.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-2.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-3.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-4.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-5.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-6.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-7.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-8.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-9.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-10.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/5-months-of-you/gallery/7d0f8504-a51c-4dd9-946d-8af6a6eb4ee3-11.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh