With all the giggles, games, and togetherness, these are the moments you’ll always look back on with a big smile. After all, fun is simply better when Mama’s and Khala’s are around! 🥰❤️', '2026-06-01', '', 'toddler', 'https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/cover.webp', '["https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-0.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-1.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-2.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-3.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-4.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-5.mp4","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-6.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-7.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-8.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-9.webp","https://azain-media-worker.aaawaizshaikh.workers.dev/media/media/memories/mamujaan-s-khalajaan-s/gallery/0fa7c3d1-07f4-4698-b540-e89aeeffa7c6-10.webp","https://azain